WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
big joke

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,400
Rushing back from school early in the morning

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
You were with Brother Tong at the old house last night, right?

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,480
Stop talking nonsense. Hey, where is Brother Tong?

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,600
Why didn't I go back to school with you?

6
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,400
He still has big things to do in his hometown

7
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,600
I will go directly to the depths of Daqing Mountain to hunt for treasures later.

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,400
He said that he would make another billion on this trip and come back to hunt for treasure again.

9
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,400
Earn more than one billion

10
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,000
This Daqingshan is his cash machine.

11
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The boss explained it before he left.

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Let you quickly find a construction team to build an independent villa in Xiaoshui Village

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,400
Buy another four-wheel truck to transport materials

14
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,400
All that's left is to recruit auction house employees. Don't delay your business. Don't worry.

15
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,600
Today I will go to the most beautiful front desk lady in Mist

16
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,800
Just follow the standards Tongge said

17
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,200
The monthly salary is 30,000 to 50,000 yuan

18
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,800
Recruiting a front desk employee of 30,000 to 50,000 yuan is crazy.

19
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,000
Industry rules: several thousand yuan a month

20
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Give up to 10,000

21
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,600
Can 10,000 yuan recruit top-notch beauties?

22
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,400
The front desk of our auction house Rijin Kaifeng is the facade, and of course we need to attract items.

23
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,400
My boss told me before

24
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,200
To start a company, it is necessary to have beautiful women who are eye-catching.

25
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,200
Nonsense

26
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,800
The boss is not a rich person

27
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,800
The boss is not

28
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,800
But I am

29
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,400
I'll take the blame for Brother Tong.
